# The Inner Light, break (figure 128.3)
# As fig. 128.1: one line, the instrumentation labels as bar marks, quarter-note columns. In bars
# 3-4 the oboe plays a free riff after its G that Pollack draws as "/\/\/\"; it is shown as text.
#? Octaves are a guess, matching fig. 128.1.
key Eb

